      "content": "GADEBRIDGE PARK 1. 5252 TL 0508 5/142                                     Bridge over River Gade II 2. Early C19.  Cast iron single segmental span with central console, pierced decoration to arch and spandrels. Cast iron geometrical pattern railings.  Central and end piers panelled with bases and entablatures, shield outline raised on outer face of each central pier of railings. Listing NGR: TL0525408041"
